 ## Risks / Trade-offs
 
-- [A future image channel expects a different JSON or multipart representation]
-  -> Keep this fix scoped to the established AIGC JSON image relay contract;
-  introduce an explicit per-channel capability only when a second incompatible
-  channel is configured.
+- [A downstream channel needs a provider-specific representation] -> Keep the
+  AIGC compatibility output canonical and handle true provider differences in
+  the existing channel adapter, without adding AIGC awareness there.
